Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:08:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] feat(web)!: remove sponsor placements and sponsors page

Drops the sponsor API, dashboard/login placements, sponsors page and navigation, along with their i18n keys and generated OpenAPI/docs. The feature is no longer part of this fork.
